{"title":"Molten Colossus","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 65 Fire Elemental that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>16</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus?lv=65\">Lv 65</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>16</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/molten-colossus?lv=65\" title=\"Pick level 65\"><td><b>65</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 39 total, 39 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×39</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 16</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6304\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fire Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/cinderling\">Cinderling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/magma-elemental\">Magma Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinder-heart\">Cinder Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/00b2310cc2b25b1648e1.svg\" alt=\"Molten Colossus\"></div><h3>Molten Colossus</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 65)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fire Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>3.72</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}